      "translation": {"english_text": "Why even ask him that! Is there a child who says it doesn't want a banana?.... Ah, the child.... .... ....", "mode": "prose-faithful", "notes": ["The source line is visibly broken by ellipses around the banana/child comparison. The translation keeps the rhetorical sense but does not invent missing words."]}
